<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zoran Corp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zoran Corp raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Zoran Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- Expects Zoran to earn $0.75 a share in 1997 and $1.20 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Zoran gained 1 to 22.</p>
</text>
